* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows PowerShell：老版本对 LF 脚本不够稳，且带中文的脚本必须 CRLF+BOM 才不乱码
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
